      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-stamp-duty-amendment-act-1986.pdf, p.1",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to sub-section (2), this Act shall come into operation on\nthe first day of the month next following the month in which it receives\nthe Royal Assent.\n\nAustralian\nCapital\nTerritory\nStamp Duty Amendment\nNo. 147, 1986\n(2) Paragraphs 4 (h) and 5 (c) and (d) and sub-section 6 (2) shall be\ndeemed to have come into operation on 10 June 1986.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to sub-section (2), this Act shall come into operation on\nthe first day of the month next following the month in which it receives\nthe Royal Assent.\n\nAustralian\nCapital\nTerritory\nStamp Duty Amendment\nNo. 147, 1986\n(2) Paragraphs 4 (h) and 5 (c) and (d) and sub-section 6 (2) shall be\ndeemed to have come into operation on 10 June 1986.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-stamp-duty-amendment-act-1986-sec-2-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-stamp-duty-amendment-act-1986-sec-2-ss-2"
        }
