      "cml:integrityHash": "22acc3e6b1dd2e14f0ccd32bf77ec21e30509fdf057c8195da42f27b9a8edf09"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-capital-territory-stamp-duty-amendment-act-1986#sec-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2 Section 2",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 1,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to sub-section (2), this Act shall come into operation on\nthe first day of the month next following the month in which it receives\nthe Royal Assent.\n\nAustralian\nCapital\nTerritory\nStamp Duty Amendment\nNo. 147, 1986\n(2) Paragraphs 4 (h) and 5 (c) and (d) and sub-section 6 (2) shall be\ndeemed to have come into operation on 10 June 1986."
    },
