    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-stamp-duty-amendment-act-1986-sec-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 Section 6",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-capital-territory-stamp-duty-amendment-act-1986#sec-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-capital-territory-stamp-duty-amendment-act-1986.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-stamp-duty-amendment-act-1986.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The amendments made by this Act (other than paragraphs 4 (h)\nand 5 (c) and (d)) apply, in relation to duty on instruments, as follows:\n(a)\nin the case of an instrument being a Crown lease—to such an\ninstrument the date of commencement of which specified in the\nlease is on or after the date of commencement of this sub-section;\n(b) in any other case—to an instrument executed on or after the date\nof commencement of this sub-section.\n(2) The amendments made by paragraphs 4 (h) and 5 (c) and (d) apply\nin relation to instruments executed on or after the date of commencement\nof this sub-section.\nNOTE",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The amendments made by this Act (other than paragraphs 4 (h)\nand 5 (c) and (d)) apply, in relation to duty on instruments, as follows:\n(a)\nin the case of an instrument being a Crown lease—to such an\ninstrument the date of commencement of which specified in the\nlease is on or after the date of commencement of this sub-section;\n(b) in any other case—to an instrument executed on or after the date\nof commencement of this sub-section.\n(2) The amendments made by paragraphs 4 (h) and 5 (c) and (d) apply\nin relation to instruments executed on or after the date of commencement\nof this sub-section.\nNOTE",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-stamp-duty-amendment-act-1986-sec-6-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-stamp-duty-amendment-act-1986-sec-6-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6db91cd837919a069a3ab20333749e1650704ae56f3f39a68f83afdaa6ca8e1b"
    },
    {
