      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The amendments made by this Act (other than paragraphs 4 (h)\nand 5 (c) and (d)) apply, in relation to duty on instruments, as follows:\n(a)\nin the case of an instrument being a Crown lease—to such an\ninstrument the date of commencement of which specified in the\nlease is on or after the date of commencement of this sub-section;\n(b) in any other case—to an instrument executed on or after the date\nof commencement of this sub-section.\n(2) The amendments made by paragraphs 4 (h) and 5 (c) and (d) apply\nin relation to instruments executed on or after the date of commencement\nof this sub-section.\nNOTE"
    },
