      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-stamp-duty-amendment-act-1986.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "No. 48, 1969, as amended. For previous amendments, see Nos. 68 and 94, 1972; No.\n216, 1973; No. 124, 1981; No. 126, 1982; and No. 170, 1985.\n[Minister's second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 15 October 1986\nSenate\non 13 November\n1986]",
      "skos:definition": "No. 48, 1969, as amended. For previous amendments, see Nos. 68 and 94, 1972; No.\n216, 1973; No. 124, 1981; No. 126, 1982; and No. 170, 1985.\n[Minister's second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 15 October 1986\nSenate\non 13 November\n1986]",
